&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;This is a stripboard Arduino without an FTDI chip. You can load sketches on the chip through the FTDI header (like the Lily Pad).&lt;/p&gt;





